>Unsafe water quick card
Use confirmed safe water for drinking, food and teeth.

Follow the local notice. For do-not-drink or do-not-use notices, switch to a safe supply for the restricted uses.
If germs are the only concern and no safe supply is available, bring clear water to a rolling boil for 1 minute (3 minutes above about 2,000 m). Cool covered.
Avoid floodwater. Boiling cannot remove fuel or toxic chemicals.

